1
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,510
You continue searching to the north.

2
00:00:21,568 --> 00:00:22,830
Make sure to search thoroughly.

3
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:23,920
- Yes!
- Yes!

4
00:00:26,112 --> 00:00:27,856
As for His Majesty
and the Empress Dowager,

5
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,280
make sure they are strictly guarded.

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,184
Report immediately
if there's anything unusual.

7
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:31,920
- Yes!
- Yes!

8
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:34,790
You guys, come with me.
- Yes!
- Yes!

9
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,470
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

10
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,320
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

11
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:43,600
Crown Prince!

12
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,750
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

13
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:52,320
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

14
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:53,430
Crown Prince!

15
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:57,824
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

16
00:00:57,872 --> 00:00:59,200
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

17
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,880
All available men have been dispatched.

18
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:03,000
The garrisoned guards nearby

19
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,430
are also rushing here.

20
00:01:04,430 --> 00:01:07,060
Crown Prince!

21
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:09,008
You've been keeping watch
for most of the night.

22
00:01:09,504 --> 00:01:10,560
The night is cold and damp.

23
00:01:11,590 --> 00:01:13,280
You should go back and rest for a while.

24
00:01:13,712 --> 00:01:15,480
The mountains here stretch on endlessly,

25
00:01:15,776 --> 00:01:16,960
and the terrain is complex.

26
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,840
The enemy deliberately struck here,

27
00:01:21,430 --> 00:01:23,560
knowing it would be hard to search.

28
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,510
Searching the mountain inch by inch

29
00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:27,200
is like looking for a needle
in a haystack.

30
00:01:27,232 --> 00:01:28,310
I will stay right here.

31
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:30,790
Mo Yuan can report to me at any time.

32
00:01:32,070 --> 00:01:33,310
I want to see the Crown Prince

33
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:35,120
return safely.

34
00:01:37,150 --> 00:01:38,680
Crown Prince!

35
00:02:58,020 --> 00:02:58,800
=Blossoms of Power=

36
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:01,690
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

37
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:04,660
=Episode 30=

38
00:03:24,768 --> 00:03:26,030
You're not pretending anymore?

39
00:03:26,304 --> 00:03:28,080
What are you talking about, Changqing?

40
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:29,520
My body is weak.

41
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,870
You can't just leave me behind.

42
00:03:50,630 --> 00:03:51,840
I must say, all these years,

43
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:53,400
you've really put on a good act.

44
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,280
If I didn't pretend,

45
00:03:54,352 --> 00:03:56,310
how could I experience
this rare brotherly bond?

46
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:58,750
Don't run!
Stop right there!

47
00:03:59,552 --> 00:04:01,120
- What happened to the brotherly bond?
- Stop!

48
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,560
- After them!
- After them!

49
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:03,870
Wait for me!

50
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,150
Get them!

51
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,470
Hurry!

52
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:07,910
Chase them!

53
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:09,120
After them!

54
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:10,910
Get them!

55
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,160
Search carefully!

56
00:04:17,750 --> 00:04:19,120
You guys, go that way.

57
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,040
- Yes!
- Yes!

58
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:27,680
Search thoroughly!

59
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:28,870
- Yes!
- Yes!

60
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:34,560
This way!

61
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,480
Over there!

62
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:48,920
Stop!

63
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,360
After them!
Stop!

64
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,430
Don't run!

65
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,480
They're over there!

66
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:46,510
Stop!

67
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,360
Stop!

68
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:51,920
That way!
Get them!

69
00:05:58,870 --> 00:05:59,560
After them!
That way!

70
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:03,830
Changqing,

71
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,390
keep going down this path,

72
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:07,050
and you'll be able
to leave this mountain.

73
00:06:07,104 --> 00:06:07,920
What about you?

74
00:06:08,304 --> 00:06:09,280
You're injured.

75
00:06:09,290 --> 00:06:10,590
I'll stay behind to hold them off.

76
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,120
No.

77
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,600
If we leave, we'll leave together.

78
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,800
I don't want to owe you a favor.

79
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,040
Aren't you best at saving your own skin?

80
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,270
If you don't go back for reinforcements,

81
00:06:19,270 --> 00:06:20,420
neither of us will make it out.

82
00:06:20,430 --> 00:06:22,180
Tell Xihe not to worry
and wait for my return.

83
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:22,600
Go.

84
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:23,870
Come back.

85
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:39,190
Crown Prince!

86
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:40,680
Crown Prince!

87
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,800
Your Highness,
we still haven't found any trace

88
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,656
of Prince Xin and the Crown Prince
in the east.

89
00:06:44,992 --> 00:06:45,952
Send another squad

90
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:47,190
to search deeper into the west.

91
00:06:47,190 --> 00:06:47,630
Yes.

92
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:48,680
Somebody, come quick.

93
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,680
Your Highnesses,

94
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,000
Prince Xin has returned.

95
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:55,480
Crown Prince!

96
00:06:57,310 --> 00:06:57,870
Let me.

97
00:06:59,000 --> 00:06:59,600
Changqing,

98
00:06:59,870 --> 00:07:00,920
are you badly hurt?

99
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,240
It's nothing serious.

100
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:03,950
Prince Xin,

101
00:07:03,950 --> 00:07:05,670
why didn't the Crown Prince return
with you?

102
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:06,560
Where is he?

103
00:07:06,624 --> 00:07:08,576
Crown Prince and I were trapped
in a cave.

104
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:11,270
We encountered a large group of pursuers
while escaping.

105
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,040
To cover my escape,

106
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:15,424
Crown Prince stayed behind alone
to hold them off.

107
00:07:15,630 --> 00:07:16,750
Was he injured?

108
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,000
At least when I left,

109
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,750
he was fine.

110
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,560
He also said

111
00:07:27,232 --> 00:07:28,390
to tell you not to worry.

112
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,270
Let's go rescue him quickly.

113
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,160
Follow me.

114
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:32,430
Mo Yuan.
Changqing.

115
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,240
Crown Prince,

116
00:08:08,830 --> 00:08:10,630
I finally managed to invite you here.

117
00:08:15,456 --> 00:08:16,920
Since my forth brother invited me,

118
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,680
how could I not come?

119
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:33,000
You knew it was me all along.

120
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,670
The people who besieged Changqing and me

121
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,600
were highly skilled.

122
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,400
They were definitely
not ordinary soldiers.

123
00:08:38,448 --> 00:08:40,360
But they tied me up and didn't kill me.

124
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:44,390
Right now,

125
00:08:44,544 --> 00:08:46,480
the only person who doesn't want me dead

126
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,080
yet is my sworn enemy

127
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,720
is none other than you.

128
00:08:49,936 --> 00:08:51,312
You also know

129
00:08:51,344 --> 00:08:52,960
that after that incident in northwest,

130
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,120
you have no chance

131
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,120
at the throne anymore.

132
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,360
So I guessed

133
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,360
that you must have
some unfinished business

134
00:08:58,384 --> 00:09:00,720
and wanted to clear things up
with me face to face.

135
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:06,840
Huayong,

136
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:09,390
I truly admire your intellect

137
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,630
and respect your methods.

138
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:14,960
Come to think of it,

139
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,670
the biggest mistake I made

140
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,200
was from the very beginning

141
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,840
going against you.

142
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,030
But don't worry,

143
00:09:24,550 --> 00:09:25,440
today,

144
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,750
I'm not here to hurt you.

145
00:09:29,870 --> 00:09:31,030
I just want

146
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,480
to make a deal

147
00:09:33,550 --> 00:09:34,790
with you.

148
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,120
What kind of deal?

149
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,320
Haven't you always wanted to know

150
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,720
who poisoned you?

151
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,120
I can tell you the truth right now.

152
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,440
But my condition

153
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:56,440
is to clear Yanyan of all her crimes,

154
00:09:56,544 --> 00:09:59,100
and allow her to be buried
with the honors of a Princess Consort

155
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,272
in the imperial mausoleum,

156
00:10:00,448 --> 00:10:01,872
and receive ancestral offerings.

157
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,960
As long as you agree,

158
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,240
it can be done.

159
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,030
Back then, Father

160
00:10:07,248 --> 00:10:10,000
arranged my marriage to the princess
of the fallen Nanzhou state.

161
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,320
He used my marriage
to show his benevolence,

162
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:14,840
but it also ruined my path
to becoming the Crown Prince.

163
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,870
Later, Yanyan and I fell in love.

164
00:10:18,270 --> 00:10:19,200
I thought

165
00:10:19,750 --> 00:10:21,390
we could grow old together.

166
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:24,150
I didn't expect Father

167
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,720
to actually reprimand me,

168
00:10:26,784 --> 00:10:28,440
saying I was supposed to monitor her,

169
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,270
not fall in love with her.

170
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,150
It's truly ridiculous.

171
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,270
My future,

172
00:10:40,790 --> 00:10:41,870
my feelings,

173
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,240
to him,

174
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,840
are nothing
but stepping stones to the throne.

175
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,320
From childhood to adulthood,

176
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,440
when has he ever treated me
like his own son?

177
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,120
How could I not hate him?

178
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,670
But Yanyan was always innocent.

179
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,510
She was always coerced by me,

180
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,000
taking the blame for me,

181
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,240
and doing many things against her will.

182
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:12,240
The person I've let down the most
in this life

183
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:14,750
is her.

184
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,120
Li Yanhui was deeply devoted.

185
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:20,440
As for burying her

186
00:11:20,608 --> 00:11:21,792
in the imperial mausoleum,

187
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,240
I can promise you.

188
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,320
Then, thank you, Huayong,

189
00:11:32,032 --> 00:11:33,600
for fulfilling my long-cherished wish.

190
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:36,550
But I don't need you
to negotiate terms with me.

191
00:11:38,864 --> 00:11:40,528
I want you to return to the palace

192
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,480
and plead guilty to Father.

193
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,240
Plead guilty?

194
00:11:54,870 --> 00:11:55,720
Huayong,

195
00:11:57,270 --> 00:11:58,720
do you think our father

196
00:11:58,910 --> 00:12:00,750
is some kind of honorable gentleman?

197
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:03,670
Did you know

198
00:12:04,512 --> 00:12:06,630
that Prince Qian treated him
like a blood brother,

199
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,000
yet he, on the battlefield,

200
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:10,440
brutally murdered his older brother
to usurp the throne?

201
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,240
Xiao Changtai,

202
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,320
stop your nonsense!

203
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:21,600
Actually, you and I are the same.

204
00:12:22,390 --> 00:12:24,120
We are just pitiful people
used by Father

205
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,870
and then abandoned.

206
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,550
I can tell you the truth right now.

207
00:12:31,616 --> 00:12:33,184
The one who poisoned you back then,

208
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,384
leaving you bedridden

209
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:36,910
and doomed to an early death,
is none other

210
00:12:37,030 --> 00:12:38,630
than our good father!

211
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,270
Xiao Changtai,

212
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:47,030
I've long heard

213
00:12:47,670 --> 00:12:48,870
these rumors you speak of.

214
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:51,240
Don't seek revenge on the wrong person.

215
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,200
But don't delude yourself into thinking

216
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,910
you can drive a wedge
between Father and me with this.

217
00:13:06,750 --> 00:13:07,960
Once you see this,

218
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,150
you'll have no choice but to believe it.

219
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,200
(Year 8 of Youning, Daxing.)

220
00:13:18,210 --> 00:13:20,440
(Year 8 of Youning)
(I'm here to confess to all ancestors.)

221
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:22,710
(Tablet of Prince Qian, Xiao Juewei)
(My sins burden the state,)

222
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,790
(causing the royal family
to lose its virtue.)

223
00:13:25,030 --> 00:13:30,510
(Emperor Youning, Xiao Juechong, plotted
to murder his own brother, Prince Qian.)

224
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:34,870
(Fearing chaos would ruin the country,
I helped him hide his crime,)

225
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,510
(letting his sibling's blood be shed.)

226
00:13:37,664 --> 00:13:39,600
(Edict of Repentance)
(This is my first sin.)

227
00:13:40,270 --> 00:13:43,550
(Later, I learned he secretly
harmed his own son, Xiao Huayong.)

228
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,200
(But I dared not expose it.)

229
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:48,150
(Though I sheltered
the young child from disaster,)

230
00:13:48,270 --> 00:13:50,960
(Tablet of Prince Qian, Xiao Juewei)
(I still cannot escape the blame.)

231
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,030
(This is my second sin.)

232
00:13:53,344 --> 00:13:56,190
(Meng Weeps Blood and Kowtows)
(I received the ancestors' protection,)

233
00:13:56,200 --> 00:14:00,240
(yet I indulged my son in doing evil,
violating morality and heaven.)

234
00:14:00,550 --> 00:14:03,200
(Today, I bare my heart
with this edict of repentance,)

235
00:14:03,589 --> 00:14:05,139
(praying to the heavens)

236
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:09,320
(Edict of Repentance)
(to bless Daxing with order and peace.)

237
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,240
Back then, Father murdered Prince Qian.

238
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:13,200
If this matter were exposed,

239
00:14:13,670 --> 00:14:14,720
the various factions

240
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:16,630
would be unrestrained.

241
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:19,750
Perhaps they would raise their
own armies and divide the empire.

242
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:22,510
Grandmother either had
to join him in death,

243
00:14:23,510 --> 00:14:24,910
or cover for him

244
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,784
to ensure his ascension to the throne.

245
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,960
She had no choice at the time.

246
00:14:29,910 --> 00:14:31,000
Out of helplessness,

247
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,670
Grandmother covered up
all of Father's sins.

248
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,670
On this edict of repentance,

249
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:38,000
every word is written
with a bleeding heart.

250
00:14:38,630 --> 00:14:40,080
It's written clearly.

251
00:14:41,670 --> 00:14:43,150
Even if you don't believe my words,

252
00:14:43,728 --> 00:14:44,910
you must know full well

253
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:47,360
whether this handwriting is that

254
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,600
of Grandmother herself.

255
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:54,550
Why did Father want to kill me?

256
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:59,440
Why bother racking your brains over it?

257
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,390
I will let you go.

258
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:06,150
You can ask him yourself.

259
00:15:07,270 --> 00:15:08,720
Wouldn't that be better?

260
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:13,200
But sometimes,

261
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,670
I truly don't understand.

262
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,630
Why would a sickly person like me

263
00:15:17,630 --> 00:15:20,390
receive such generous treatment
and care from you?

264
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:25,720
Whoever fed you the cherry cheese

265
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:28,910
is the one who poisoned you.

266
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,910
A word of advice for you.

267
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:34,960
Don't put too much trust

268
00:15:35,750 --> 00:15:37,320
in your father.

269
00:15:37,910 --> 00:15:39,550
In his heart,

270
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,150
there is only the throne.

271
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:46,600
There is no father and son.

272
00:15:52,510 --> 00:16:04,150
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

273
00:16:04,150 --> 00:16:06,150
- Where are you, Crown Prince?
- Crown Prince!

274
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:09,510
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

275
00:16:09,910 --> 00:16:10,720
Crown Princess,

276
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:11,840
it's getting late,

277
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,620
and the paths
are becoming harder to navigate.

278
00:16:13,632 --> 00:16:15,440
Let me have someone
escort you back first.

279
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,360
We've got it from here.

280
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,648
Until I find the Crown Prince,

281
00:16:17,904 --> 00:16:19,280
I absolutely will not go back.

282
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:25,390
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

283
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:26,000
Hurry!

284
00:16:27,030 --> 00:16:28,270
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

285
00:16:28,270 --> 00:16:28,840
Let's go!

286
00:16:29,030 --> 00:16:30,270
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

287
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,070
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

288
00:17:04,070 --> 00:17:04,680
Crown Prince!

289
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,900
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

290
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,590
Crown Prince, where are you?

291
00:17:07,590 --> 00:17:11,510
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

292
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:14,510
Slender-Leaf Qionghua.

293
00:17:16,070 --> 00:17:17,070
Moonlit Cool Fragrance.

294
00:17:17,070 --> 00:17:19,640
- Crown Prince!
- Crown Prince!

295
00:18:16,570 --> 00:18:21,950
♪As time rushes by,
spring brings life, autumn brings death♪

296
00:18:23,650 --> 00:18:29,440
♪A heart weathered by frost
will melt in love♪

297
00:18:30,460 --> 00:18:36,220
♪Across miles of treasured moments,
every move is a game of truth and lies♪

298
00:18:37,570 --> 00:18:43,360
♪With this broken body,
I'll become your armor♪

299
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:50,030
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

300
00:18:50,190 --> 00:18:57,780
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

301
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:00,000
Let's go.

302
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:01,790
Mo Yuan.

303
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:05,300
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

304
00:19:05,469 --> 00:19:08,909
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

305
00:19:08,990 --> 00:19:10,420
♪My longing can level♪

306
00:19:11,270 --> 00:19:12,310
Let me look at you.

307
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:13,830
Are you hurt?

308
00:19:15,550 --> 00:19:16,350
I'm fine.

309
00:19:16,370 --> 00:19:18,710
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

310
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:19,680
I'm perfectly fine.

311
00:19:20,830 --> 00:19:22,000
I'm not hurt at all.

312
00:19:22,940 --> 00:19:27,580
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

313
00:19:27,590 --> 00:19:29,160
Why did they let you go?

314
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:33,300
♪I have a dream of a long wind
in my sleeves♪

315
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:36,830
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

316
00:19:36,970 --> 00:19:40,260
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

317
00:19:40,380 --> 00:19:41,920
♪My longing can level♪

318
00:19:42,110 --> 00:19:43,750
Changtai let me out.

319
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:46,750
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

320
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:47,880
Let's go home first.

321
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:50,910
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

322
00:19:50,910 --> 00:19:54,290
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

323
00:19:54,290 --> 00:19:57,280
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

324
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:58,510
Your Highness!
Your Highness!

325
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:00,920
Your Highness!

326
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,720
Your Highness!

327
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:05,190
♪May the sand and dirt in my sleeves♪

328
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:07,980
♪Become the tears
in the corner of my eyes♪

329
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:11,430
♪And blossom into a flower♪

330
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:20,060
(Clarity and Serenity)

331
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:22,110
Hurry up.

332
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:23,920
Hurry.

333
00:20:28,070 --> 00:20:30,470
Your Majesty, Xiao Changtai has fled
into the deep mountains.

334
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:32,704
We've lost his trail.
His whereabouts are unknown.

335
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,350
Keep searching.

336
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:35,312
Yes, Your Majesty.

337
00:20:41,510 --> 00:20:42,200
Your Majesty,

338
00:20:42,210 --> 00:20:44,300
the poison in the Crown Prince
has flared up again.

339
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:45,350
It's very aggressive.

340
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:47,000
Much more severe than before.

341
00:20:51,968 --> 00:20:53,552
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

342
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:54,590
Your Majesty.

343
00:20:57,550 --> 00:20:58,240
Your Highness.

344
00:21:02,070 --> 00:21:02,720
Your Highness.

345
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:05,920
Your Highness.

346
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,110
Xihe.

347
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,160
I'm here.

348
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,240
I'm right here.

349
00:21:13,550 --> 00:21:14,440
Xihe.

350
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:21,240
Huayong, come.

351
00:21:27,550 --> 00:21:28,110
What's wrong?
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

352
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:29,880
Call the imperial physician!
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

353
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:33,660
- Huayong.
- Call the imperial physician!

354
00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:34,810
- Huayong!
- Your Highness!

355
00:21:34,912 --> 00:21:36,496
- Huayong!
- Your Highness!

356
00:21:37,750 --> 00:21:38,680
Father.

357
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:41,400
I don't believe it.

358
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,510
Don't be afraid.

359
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:43,920
It was just a dream.

360
00:22:17,790 --> 00:22:18,550
Your Highness,

361
00:22:19,440 --> 00:22:20,160
you're awake.

362
00:22:22,270 --> 00:22:23,440
Xihe,

363
00:22:24,256 --> 00:22:26,000
you've been with me this whole time?

364
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:04,440
This is the medicine made
from the Slender-Leaf Qionghua?

365
00:23:09,790 --> 00:23:10,440
Your Highness,

366
00:23:11,880 --> 00:23:13,400
while I was watching over you,

367
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,440
I kept thinking

368
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,440
that when you woke up,

369
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:20,960
there was something I must tell you.

370
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,030
What is it?

371
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:24,200
No matter the dangers ahead,

372
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:25,720
I will stay by your side

373
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:27,440
and press forward with you.

374
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:29,110
In my heart,

375
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:31,160
you are the best.

376
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:34,440
With you here,

377
00:23:35,790 --> 00:23:37,350
my heart has found its home.

378
00:23:53,900 --> 00:23:56,700
(Chenning Hall)

379
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:05,510
(Why did Father want to kill me?)

380
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:08,160
Why bother racking your brains over it?

381
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:12,030
I will let you go.

382
00:24:12,310 --> 00:24:13,640
(You can ask him yourself.)

383
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:15,640
(Wouldn't that be better?)

384
00:24:23,830 --> 00:24:25,440
Your Majesty, time for your medicine.

385
00:24:30,310 --> 00:24:31,350
Greetings, Father.

386
00:24:36,550 --> 00:24:37,720
Huayong...

387
00:24:38,510 --> 00:24:40,400
My boy is back.

388
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:42,830
Your Majesty.

389
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:45,270
What's wrong with His Majesty?

390
00:24:46,030 --> 00:24:47,200
Your Highness,

391
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,790
after you went missing,

392
00:24:48,790 --> 00:24:50,720
His Majesty worried day and night,

393
00:24:51,070 --> 00:24:52,750
and caught a cold.

394
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:54,830
Come.

395
00:24:56,590 --> 00:24:57,550
Huayong,

396
00:24:57,960 --> 00:25:00,110
let me take a good look at you.

397
00:25:20,590 --> 00:25:22,030
Quick, tell me,

398
00:25:22,720 --> 00:25:24,350
how did you get back?

399
00:25:32,110 --> 00:25:33,310
I caught them off guard

400
00:25:34,270 --> 00:25:35,590
and escaped on my own.

401
00:25:37,350 --> 00:25:38,310
Good.

402
00:25:39,270 --> 00:25:40,400
That's good.

403
00:25:42,590 --> 00:25:44,350
Seeing my boy,

404
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:45,880
my illness

405
00:25:47,270 --> 00:25:49,240
is more than half cured.

406
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,030
Be good, Huayong.

407
00:26:17,830 --> 00:26:19,030
Drink your medicine.

408
00:26:20,590 --> 00:26:22,720
You'll slowly get better.

409
00:26:30,350 --> 00:26:30,880
Come.

410
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:32,480
Father, it's broken.

411
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:34,640
Come.

412
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:36,200
Let me see.

413
00:28:38,510 --> 00:28:39,550
Let me take a look.

414
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,510
It's cracked.

415
00:28:46,510 --> 00:28:48,310
As long as we repair it with care,

416
00:28:49,350 --> 00:28:51,000
it can be fixed.

417
00:29:11,270 --> 00:29:12,240
Father.

418
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:13,720
You're awake.

419
00:29:21,720 --> 00:29:22,590
Huayong,

420
00:29:23,590 --> 00:29:25,350
I've fixed this box.

421
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,750
From now on, use it

422
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:30,400
to hold your favorite candies.

423
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:36,920
Thank you, Father.

424
00:29:48,830 --> 00:29:50,000
This is what I

425
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:52,590
used as a child.

426
00:29:54,510 --> 00:29:56,310
I can't believe you kept it
all this time.

427
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:01,960
Inside are

428
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:06,240
my favorite honey candies
from childhood.

429
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:30,000
Huayong,

430
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:35,790
you've suffered.

431
00:30:43,070 --> 00:30:45,400
Your body is still weak.

432
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,750
Don't worry about me.

433
00:30:51,550 --> 00:30:53,680
Hurry back to your palace and rest.

434
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:56,510
Get up.

435
00:31:05,550 --> 00:31:06,680
Go back.

436
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:08,270
Let me help you lie down.

437
00:31:32,590 --> 00:31:33,590
I will take my leave.

438
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,680
Let's go back.

439
00:33:49,460 --> 00:33:52,700
(East Palace)

440
00:34:14,928 --> 00:34:16,320
It's late and the dew is heavy.

441
00:34:16,624 --> 00:34:18,320
Why are you still out here in the wind?

442
00:34:20,070 --> 00:34:21,280
You haven't rested yet?

443
00:34:22,880 --> 00:34:24,000
I'm waiting for you.

444
00:34:33,070 --> 00:34:34,840
You went to see His Majesty today.

445
00:34:36,150 --> 00:34:38,360
Was it about
what the Fourth Prince said?

446
00:34:41,440 --> 00:34:43,400
He was desperate and talking nonsense.

447
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:45,280
How could it be taken seriously?

448
00:34:45,550 --> 00:34:46,550
Father has ordered

449
00:34:46,592 --> 00:34:48,160
a strict manhunt across the country.

450
00:34:48,208 --> 00:34:49,150
Father and I

451
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:52,230
have never had a rift.

452
00:34:53,440 --> 00:34:54,400
And we never will.

453
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:01,360
If you want to be alone for a while,

454
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:04,230
I'll go back and wait for you.

455
00:35:14,510 --> 00:35:15,630
Stay with me.

456
00:35:17,520 --> 00:35:18,630
Just for a little while.

457
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:21,590
Okay.

458
00:35:22,640 --> 00:35:23,630
I'll stay with you.

459
00:35:25,230 --> 00:35:26,230
But...

460
00:35:27,590 --> 00:35:28,510
not here.

461
00:35:39,710 --> 00:35:40,550
Your Highness,

462
00:35:40,550 --> 00:35:41,960
the scented bath is ready.

463
00:35:42,360 --> 00:35:43,070
You may leave.

464
00:35:43,590 --> 00:35:44,150
Understood.

465
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:47,480
Your Highness,

466
00:35:47,616 --> 00:35:49,030
go change your clothes first.

467
00:36:41,930 --> 00:36:44,600
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

468
00:36:45,960 --> 00:36:48,670
♪Alone for several autumns♪

469
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:53,110
This scented bath is indeed different.

470
00:36:53,400 --> 00:36:55,000
Just the smell of it is refreshing.

471
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:58,920
In this bath,

472
00:36:59,030 --> 00:37:02,840
I used roselle, sour jujube seed,
and silktree bark.

473
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:04,480
They are all herbs

474
00:37:05,320 --> 00:37:07,150
that calm the mind
and soothe the nerves.

475
00:37:07,560 --> 00:37:12,620
♪For all eternity♪

476
00:37:13,060 --> 00:37:15,710
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

477
00:37:16,290 --> 00:37:19,900
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

478
00:37:21,070 --> 00:37:23,810
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

479
00:37:24,270 --> 00:37:28,110
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

480
00:37:29,050 --> 00:37:31,890
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

481
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,670
Is the water temperature okay?

482
00:37:37,440 --> 00:37:38,440
It's perfect.

483
00:37:40,670 --> 00:37:41,800
Are you still tired?

484
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:45,630
With you here,

485
00:37:47,648 --> 00:37:48,710
everything is alright.

486
00:38:08,848 --> 00:38:10,190
Congratulations, Your Highness.

487
00:38:10,190 --> 00:38:11,880
The Crown Princess is pregnant.

488
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:13,510
We're having a baby.

489
00:38:13,616 --> 00:38:15,470
(Three years old, four years old)
If there is truly a way

490
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:17,230
(Fourteen years old)
to let me stay with her a little longer,

491
00:38:17,230 --> 00:38:18,992
even if it means enduring the agony
of reforging my body,

492
00:38:19,030 --> 00:38:20,000
I am willing to do it.

493
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:21,710
Tell me the truth.

494
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:24,320
Am I already beyond cure?

495
00:38:24,350 --> 00:38:29,490
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

496
00:38:31,510 --> 00:38:34,450
♪I've hidden so many words♪

497
00:38:35,070 --> 00:38:37,870
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

498
00:38:38,740 --> 00:38:45,710
♪So never uncover♪

499
00:38:45,900 --> 00:38:48,260
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

500
00:38:49,390 --> 00:38:52,120
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

501
00:38:53,080 --> 00:38:58,420
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

502
00:39:00,180 --> 00:39:03,000
♪Every answer I gave♪

503
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:06,650
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

504
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:10,810
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

505
00:39:11,070 --> 00:39:14,380
♪How hard it truly was?♪

506
00:39:17,350 --> 00:39:20,790
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

507
00:39:21,780 --> 00:39:24,110
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

508
00:39:25,380 --> 00:39:31,140
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

509
00:39:32,550 --> 00:39:35,680
♪It's a shame I never could♪

510
00:39:36,130 --> 00:39:39,140
♪Give you a moon in return♪

511
00:39:39,250 --> 00:39:45,890
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

512
00:39:45,890 --> 00:39:49,560
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

513
00:39:50,430 --> 00:39:53,190
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

514
00:39:53,630 --> 00:39:56,760
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

515
00:39:57,200 --> 00:40:03,150
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

516
00:40:04,550 --> 00:40:08,100
♪You'll never♪

517
00:40:08,380 --> 00:40:17,850
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

518
00:40:44,020 --> 00:40:47,500
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
